UPSERT finding:steam_node_e8_is_parent_matrix SET statement='In list-5 stage prop nodes +0xE8 points at the PARENT NODE\'S +0xA8 matrix (not a model); FUN_140620740 loads it as the stack top before applying the node\'s own pos/rot/scale and stores the composed world matrix back into node+0xA8 (FUN_140846a00). DC counterpart loc_8c0301ce with the per-node body loc_8c0301f6.', status='confirmed', confidence='high', date='2026-09-02', note='Read on both builds during the 2026-09-02 Steam<->SH4 function-map crawl; see docs/STEAM-SH4-FUNCTION-MAP.md and docs/STAGE-DRAW-GHIDRA.md.';
