UPSERT finding:steam_pool_tail_pointer_scaled SET statement='The object-pool bookkeeping after the 256-node pool is pointer-scaled between builds, not a flat delta: DC 0x8C287A54 {free_head, free_tail, heads[14], tails[14]} (4 B each) then counts[14] u16, freecnt u16, freecnt2 u16 <-> Steam blk+0x2EDD8 with 8 B pointers (heads blk+0x2EDE8, tails 0x2EE58, counts 0x2EEC8, free counts 0x2EEE4/6). Draw-list handles are likewise 4 -> 8 B (0x8C287DE0+L*0x180+i*4 <-> blk+0x2F4D0+L*0x300+i*8). Supersedes the flat delta 0x8C258910 in memory note mvc2-dc-steam-block-map for that range.', status='confirmed', confidence='high', date='2026-09-02', note='Read on both builds during the 2026-09-02 Steam<->SH4 function-map crawl; see docs/STEAM-SH4-FUNCTION-MAP.md and docs/STAGE-DRAW-GHIDRA.md.';
